e":"24 May 2018","name":"Timbo","template":"citedevblog"},{"author":"Mod Timbo","url":"http://services.runescape.com/m=forum/forums.ws?74,75,52,65949497,goto,15#147","title":"Revealing Drop Rates","blogdate":"20 October 2017","archiveurl":"https://reldo.runescape.wiki/i/25774089","archivedate":"24 May 2018","name":"Timbo","template":"citedevblog"},{"author":"Mod Timbo","url":"http://services.runescape.com/m=forum/forums.ws?74,75,52,65949497,goto,15#147","title":"Revealing Drop Rates","blogdate":"20 October 2017","archiveurl":"https://reldo.runescape.wiki/i/25774089","archivedate":"24 May 2018","name":"Timbo","template":"citedevblog"},{"author":"Mod Ash","url":"http://services.runescape.com/m=devblog/view_post.ws?post_id=94","archivedate":"20 August 2011","archiveurl":"https://reldo.runescape.wiki/i/10577703","title":"Return of the Wise Old Man","blogdate":"12 May 2010","template":"citedevblog"},{"author":"Mod Fetzki, Mod Mark","url":"http://devblog.runescape.com/view_post.ws?post_id=30","title":"RuneScape Content's Answers","blogdate":"10 September 2009","archiveurl":"https://reldo.runescape.wiki/i/15585641","archivedate":"25 September 2009","template":"citedevblog"},{"author":"Jagex","url":"http://www.runescape.com/kbase/viewarticle.ws?article_id=727","archivedate":"20 June 2008","archiveurl":"https://reldo.runescape.wiki/i/18050827","title":"A New Look RuneScape: Part 2","diarydate":"16 June 2008","template":"citedevblog"},{"author":"Paul","url":"http://devblog.runescape.com/view_post.ws?post_id=123&page=1","archivedate":"9 October 2011","archiveurl":"https://archive.ph/fJJ34","title":"Development of the Mahjarrat","blogdate":"5 July 2011","template":"citedevblog"},{"url":"http://www.runescape.com/kbase/view.ws?guid=dev_diary08a","title":"A New Look RuneScape: Part 1 (of 2)","blogdate":"29 May 2008","name":"specs","author":"Jagex","archivedate":"30 May 2008","archiveurl":"https://reldo.runescape.wiki/i/18013275","template":"citedevblog"},{"url":"http://devblog.runescape.com/view_post.ws?post_id=13","archivedate":"27 June 2009","archiveurl":"https://reldo.runescape.wiki/i/10577373","title":"Mobilising Armies","author":"Andrew","work":"Developers' Blog","template":"citedevblog"},{"author":"Mod Mark","notes":"Mod Mark: Yes. There are often aspects of content that are cut before release. This can happen for many reasons, but we try to avoid it as much as possible. Truffles were going to be hunted by a wild boar pet/familiar, originally as part of the Summoning skill. We then considered adding them to the While Guthix Sleeps quest along with the broav, but time simply did not allow, so it had to be cut again.","url":"https://secure.runescape.com/m=rswiki/en/DevBlog:Blog---QA-RuneScape-Contents-Answers","title":"Q&A: RuneScape Content's Answers","blogdate":"10 September 2009","archiveurl":"https://archive.ph/ocj1n","archivedate":"25 September 2009","template":"citedevblog"},{"author":"Mod Shauny","url":"http://services.runescape.com/m=forum/forums.ws?74,75,52,65949497,goto,23#224","title":"Revealing Drop Rates","blogdate":"01 December 2017","name":"Shauny","archiveurl":"https://reldo.runescape.wiki/i/103771","archivedate":"3 December 2017","template":"citedevblog"},{"author":"Mod Timbo","url":"http://services.runescape.com/m=forum/forums.ws?74,75,52,65949497,goto,21#205","title":"Revealing Drop Rates","blogdate":"17 November 2017","archiveurl":"https://reldo.runescape.wiki/i/98146","archivedate":"4 December 2018","name":"\"drop rates\"","template":"citedevblog"},{"url":"http://devblog.runescape.com/view_post.ws?post_id=23","title":"Mark Gerhard's Answers","author":"Mod MMG","archiveurl":"https://reldo.runescape.wiki/i/15585560","archivedate":"6 August 2009","quote":"We are working hard on a new skill, which will be available to free-to-play and members and which shows our continued commitment to the free game. We are also looking to improve some of the free quests as well as early graphics.","template":"citedevblog"},{"author":"Mod Joe","url":"http://services.runescape.com/m=devblog/view_post.ws?post_id=10&project_id=3","title":"Concept","blogdate":"17 April 2009","template":"citedevblog"},{"author":"Mod Ash","url":"http://services.runescape.com/m=devblog/view_post.ws?post_id=7&project_id=2","title":"Dungeon Maps","blogdate":"2 April 2009","template":"citedevblog"},{"author":"Paul Gower","title":"Development of the Mahjarrat","blogdate":"24 June 2011","archiveurl":"https://archive.ph/fJJ34","notes":"\"The four ‘Mysteries of the Mahjarrat’ quests of 2009 were originally meant to be released as subquests of one single quest, in the same style as Recipe for Disaster. For me, this was the opportunity to introduce more of the nature of the Mahjarrat to RuneScape’s adventurers, and to move a couple of the Mahjarrat storylines in a direction ready for the ritual quest. Ultimately, the four sub quests didn’t really have enough in common to hang together under the same quest title, especially Missing my Mummy which was really more of desert quest than a Mahjarrat quest. Fortunately, they each ended up being strong enough to stand as individual releases in their own right.\"","template":"citedevblog"},{"author":"Mod Chihiro","url":"http://services.runescape.com/m=devblog/view_post.ws?post_id=9&project_id=5","title":"Rest and Musicians","blogdate":"23 April 2009","template":"citedevblog"},{"author":"Mod Hew","url":"http://services.runescape.com/m=devblog/view_post.ws?post_id=8&project_id=4","title":"Tools for Games","blogdate":"7 May 2009","template":"citedevblog"},{"author":"Mod Chihiro","url":"http://services.runescape.com/m=devblog/view_post.ws?post_id=12&project_id=6","title":"Design Review","blogdate":"5 June 2009","template":"citedevblog"},{"author":"Andrew Gower","url":"http://services.runescape.com/m=devblog/view_post.ws?post_id=13&project_id=7","title":"Mobilising Armies","blogdate":"26 June 2009","template":"citedevblog"},{"author":"Andrew Gower","url":"http://services.runescape.com/m=devblog/view_post.ws?post_id=13&project_id=7","title":"Mobilising Armies","blogdate":"26 June 2009","archivedate":"27 June 2009","archiveurl":"https://reldo.runescape.wiki/i/10577373","template":"citedevblog"},{"author":"Mod Tom S","url":"http://services.runescape.com/m=devblog/view_post.ws?post_id=18&project_id=10","title":"Back-end Upgrades","blogdate":"10 July 2009","template":"citedevblog"},{"author":"Mod Paul B","url":"http://services.runescape.com/m=devblog/view_post.ws?post_id=15&project_id=12","title":"Pack 1","blogdate":"16 July 2009","template":"citedevblog"},{"author":"Mod Nexus","url":"http://services.runescape.com/m=devblog/view_post.ws?post_id=1&project_id=13","title":"Upload Manager","blogdate":"23 July 2009","template":"citedevblog"},{"author":"Mod Kelvin","url":"http://services.runescape.com/m=devblog/view_post.ws?post_id=19&project_id=11","title":"Introduction to CM","blogdate":"24 July 2009","template":"citedevblog"},{"author":"Mod John A","url":"http://devblog.runescape.com/view_post.ws?post_id=4&page=1","archivedate":"6 June 2009","archiveurl":"https://archive.ph/NlHwV","title":"New Dwarf Quest: Implementation Begins","blogdate":"30 April 2009","notes":"Original devblog lost","template":"citedevblog"},{"author":"Mod Mark","url":"http://devblog.runescape.com/view_post.ws?post_id=16","archivedate":"25 June 2009","archiveurl":"https://reldo.runescape.wiki/i/15585486","title":"New Dwarf Quest: Feedback and Blue Blocks","blogdate":"23 June 2009","notes":"Original devblog lost","template":"citedevblog"},{"author":"Andrew","url":"http://services.runescape.com/m=devblog/view_post.ws?post_id=29","archivedate":"30 September 2011","archiveurl":"https://reldo.runescape.wiki/i/10577387","title":"Q&A: Andrew Gower's Answers","blogdate":"3 September 2009","template":"citedevblog"},{"author":"Mod Chris E","url":"http://services.runescape.com/m=devblog/view_post.ws?post_id=27","title":"RuneTek 5","blogdate":"26 August 2009","archivedate":"15 July 2011","archiveurl":"ht