","title":"Blog - Run Energy: Rest and Musicians","diarydate":"23 April 2009","template":"citedevblog"},{"url":"http://services.runescape.com/m=rswiki/en/Devblog:Content_Poll_10_New_Rewards","title":"Dev blog: Content Poll 10 - New Rewards","blogdate":"13 September 2013","archivedate":"16 September 2013","archiveurl":"https://reldo.runescape.wiki/i/14789546","template":"citedevblog"},{"url":"http://services.runescape.com/m=devblog/view_post.ws?post_id=127","title":"Clan Updates - Citadel Theatre","author":"Mod Maz","blogdate":"27 September 2011","archiveurl":"https://archive.ph/q6vjd","archivedate":"1 October 2011","template":"citedevblog"},{"author":"Mod Mark","notes":"Mod Mark: Yes. There are often aspects of content that are cut before release. This can happen for many reasons, but we try to avoid it as much as possible. Truffles were going to be hunted by a wild boar pet/familiar, originally as part of the Summoning skill. We then considered adding them to the While Guthix Sleeps quest along with the broav, but time simply did not allow, so it had to be cut again.","url":"http://devblog.runescape.com/view_post.ws?post_id=30&page=1","title":"Q&A: RuneScape Content's Answers","blogdate":"10 September 2009","archiveurl":"https://web.archive.org/web/20090925045523/http://devblog.runescape.com/view_post.ws?post_id=30&page=1","archivedate":"25 September 2009","template":"citedevblog"}]